## 4. North-star user journeys

> **عربي:** قسم — 4.1 Discover without docs (core dream)

### 4.1 Discover without docs (core dream)

1. Attach to running `CompanyERP.exe` or launch from profile.  
2. User: «دور على شاشة بتاع مردود المبيعات» / «فين شاشة تسعير الأصناف؟».  
3. Vigil builds/uses **screen map** (menus + window titles + keywords).  
4. Reply: `المخازن → تقارير → مردود المبيعات` + refs + optional open it.  
5. User: «فيها تصدير Excel؟» → snapshot current window → yes/no + control name.

> **عربي:** قسم — 4.2 Verify after change (test dream)

### 4.2 Verify after change (test dream)

1. Plan step or chat: “Verify invoice save on UAT EXE.”  
2. Launch profile `ERP-UAT`, login macro, navigate known path.  
3. Type sample, Save, `app_screenshot`, optional DB Copilot check row exists.  
4. Pass/fail → ticket note or Plan step status.

> **عربي:** قسم — 4.3 Support evidence pack

### 4.3 Support evidence pack

1. Reproduce bug in EXE with agent help.  
2. Screenshots + control values + window title.  
3. One-click into **Support Ticket Composer** (see 04-دعم-فني-وقواعد-البيانات.mdc).

