## 8. Launch & attach matrix

| Mode | Behavior |
|------|----------|
| Absolute path | `C:\Program Files\...\App.exe` |
| `'project'` | Scan workspace `bin/Debug|Release` (exists) |
| App profile | Saved path + args + cwd + env |
| Start Menu / installed search | Dream: `app_discover_installed` |
| Attach PID | Exists |
| Attach by window title | Exists (substring) — polish collisions |
| Attach by process name | Exists — polish multiple instances (pick list) |
| Elevate / Run as admin | Dream: detect need; prompt user (UAC) |
| Multiple instances | Dream: list + choose |

Args / working directory / env vars for profiles (e.g. config path) — local only.

