## 14. Security & guardrails

- [ ] Windows only for live driver (unless remote worker explicitly designed)  
- [ ] No memory scraping / credential dumping from other processes  
- [ ] No silent decompile of customer EXE as default product path  
- [ ] Snapshots may include business data on screen — treat like PII; don’t sync full trees to Firestore  
- [ ] Driver runs local; don’t expose NDJSON port on LAN  
- [ ] Nested delegates cannot drive UI (already blocked) — keep  
- [ ] User must be able to Detach / Emergency Stop clicks  

