## 24. Non-goals / guardrails (explicit)

- Not replacing SSMS / full DevExpress testers for every pixel  
- Not default IL decompile of customer binaries  
- Not scraping passwords from memory  
- Not claiming 100% DevExpress/WPF without fixtures  
- Not driving desktop UI from nested delegate workers  
- Not uploading full UI trees or screenshots to Firestore by default  
- Not blocking on HWND-in-tab embed for Phase A  

